      "recap_tekst": "England beat Norway 2-1.\nGoals: Norway — Schjelderup (36); England — Bellingham (45+2, 93).\n\nJude Bellingham struck twice as England came from behind to beat Norway in extra time and book their place in the FIFA World Cup 2026™ semi-finals.\nErling Haaland's header straight at Jordan Pickford was a warning England didn't heed, as Schjelderup swept a cross-shot in off the inside of the far post to give the Nordics a 36th-minute lead.\nJude Bellingham's brace helped the Three Lions turn the tables on Norway and secure a semi-final date with either Argentina or Switzerland.\nAfter a tentative start at Miami Stadium, Norway seized the initiative.",
